{"id":68938,"date":"2022-07-28T13:43:28","date_gmt":"2022-07-28T12:43:28","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=68938"},"modified":"2026-10-01T22:47:20","modified_gmt":"2026-10-01T21:47:20","slug":"trail-sao-goncalo-madonu","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-sao-goncalo-madonu\/","title":{"rendered":"6\u00ba Trail S\u00e3o Gon\u00e7alo Madonu 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">6\u00ba Trail S\u00e3o Gon\u00e7alo Madonu 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>6\u00ba Trail S\u00e3o Gon\u00e7alo Madonu 2026<\/strong> (Edi\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0s Cegas) realiza-se no dia <strong>8 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong> (Domingo) em <strong>Carape\u00e7os<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Barcelos<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Braga<\/strong>. Esta edi\u00e7\u00e3o especial introduz um conceito inovador de aventura e estrat\u00e9gia onde os participantes n\u00e3o t\u00eam conhecimento pr\u00e9vio do percurso completo e enfrentam Pontos de Decis\u00e3o no terreno.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O programa oficial contempla as provas de <strong>Trail Sprint \u00e0s Cegas<\/strong> (17 a 20 km), <strong>Trail Jovem \u00e0s Cegas<\/strong> (10 a 12 km) e a <strong>Caminhada Mist\u00e9rio<\/strong> (6 a 9 km). Nos Pontos de Decis\u00e3o, cada participante opta no momento entre uma variante mais curta e exigente ou outra mais longa e rolante. O evento conta com cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica, abastecimentos, apoio de seguran\u00e7a e oferta de jersey oficial.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">8 de Novembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 2