Fase:<\/strong> 8.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 25 de Outubro (com jersey))<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (de 26 de Outubro a 4 de Novembro)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o 6\u00ba Trail S\u00e3o Gon\u00e7alo Madonu 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O 6\u00ba Trail S\u00e3o Gon\u00e7alo Madonu 2026 realiza-se no domingo, 8 de Novembro de 2026, com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o e secretariado em Carape\u00e7os, no concelho de Barcelos, distrito de Braga.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e hor\u00e1rios das provas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa inclui o Trail Sprint \u00e0s Cegas (17 a 20 km) \u00e0s 09:30, o Trail Jovem \u00e0s Cegas (10 a 12 km) \u00e0s 09:45 e a Caminhada Mist\u00e9rio (6 a 9 km) \u00e0s 09:50.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona o conceito de Edi\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0s Cegas e os Pontos de Decis\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Na Edi\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0s Cegas n\u00e3o h\u00e1 ficheiro GPX pr\u00e9vio. Durante a corrida, os participantes encontram Pontos de Decis\u00e3o devidamente sinalizados, escolhendo entre uma variante mais curta com maior desn\u00edvel ou mais longa com menor desn\u00edvel.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Trail tem o valor de 14,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 25 de Outubro e 18,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 4 de Novembro. A Caminhada custa 8,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 25 de Outubro e 10,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 4 de Novembro. Todas as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es incluem oferta do jersey oficial do evento.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial e efetuar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O regulamento oficial integral em PDF pode ser consultado nesta p\u00e1gina e as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem atrav\u00e9s da plataforma oficial em https:\/\/sinctime.com\/evento\/555.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"6\u00ba Trail S\u00e3o Gon\u00e7alo Madonu 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-08\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Barcelos, Braga\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Barcelos\", \"addressRegion\": \"Braga\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o 6\u00ba Trail S\u00e3o Gon\u00e7alo Madonu 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O 6\u00ba Trail S\u00e3o Gon\u00e7alo Madonu 2026 realiza-se no domingo, 8 de Novembro de 2026, com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o e secretariado em Carape\u00e7os, no concelho de Barcelos, distrito de Braga.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e hor\u00e1rios das provas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa inclui o Trail Sprint \u00e0s Ceg